+        Your contributions directly fund housing construction, education sponsorships, water wells, and food relief in Uganda.
+      </p>
+    </header>
+
+    <!-- Impact Teaser Block (Premium Addition) -->
+    <section class="bg-[#111] border border-white/5 rounded-md p-8 mb-12 reveal">
+      <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-white mb-4">Where Your Donation Goes</h2>
+      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed mt-6">
+        <div>
+          <strong class="text-[#F4C400] text-lg block mb-1">UGX 5,000,000</strong>
+          <span class="text-xs">Builds a complete, secure brick home for a vulnerable widow and her children.</span>
+        </div>
+        <div class="w-full h-px sm:w-px sm:h-auto bg-white/10"></div>
+        <div>
+          <strong class="text-[#F4C400] text-lg block mb-1">School Fees Sponsorship</strong>
+          <span class="text-xs">Sponsors an orphaned child's primary or secondary education for an entire term, including materials.</span>
+        </div>
+        <div class="w-full h-px sm:w-px sm:h-auto bg-white/10"></div>
+        <div>
+          <strong class="text-[#F4C400] text-lg block mb-1">Water & Hygiene</strong>
+          <span class="text-xs">Funds water borehole construction and repair, bringing clean water access to entire rural villages.</span>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+    </section>
+
+    <!-- Donation Methods Grid -->
+    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12 reveal">
+      <!-- DTB Card -->
+      <div class="bg-[#111] border border-white/5 rounded-md p-8">
+        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-[#F4C400] mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
+          <i class="fas fa-building-columns text-base"></i> Bank Transfer Details
